reviews.body:
@cmungall. I have 2 questions
1) Do you think that DOID:0080172 is equivalent to MONDO:0000210 ('thiopurine metabolic disease')?

2) Currently, DOID:0060996 and its equivalent OMIM:616903 are equivalent to the obsoleted term MONDO:0014826 ('obsolete nucleoside diphosphate-linked moiety X Motif 15 deficiency'). Do you think this term should be de-obsoleted and be a sibling of MONDO:0012503?
